<p><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><strong>&lt;CHOOSE FROM ONE OF THE BELOW OPTIONS&gt;&lt;AND DELETE SENTENCE NOT REQUIRE&gt;</strong><br />
